    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "我看看大星，他去学习了。",
      "traditional": "我看看大星，他去學習了。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ kàn kan dà xīng tā qù xué xí le",
      "english": "I looked at Daxing. He went to study."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "我看看苹果，说：“你有衣服，你能和你的主人在一起，你的主人喜欢你。”",
      "traditional": "我看看蘋果，說：“你有衣服，你能和你的主人在一起，你的主人喜歡你。”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ kàn kan píng guǒ shuō nǐ yǒu yī fu nǐ néng hé nǐ de zhǔ rén zài yì qǐ nǐ de zhǔ rén xǐ huan nǐ",
      "english": "I looked at Apple and said, “You have clothes. You can be together with your owner, and your owner likes you.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "苹果说：“大星也喜欢你！”",
      "traditional": "蘋果說：“大星也喜歡你！”",
      "pinyin": "píng guǒ shuō dà xīng yě xǐ huan nǐ",
      "english": "Apple said, “Daxing likes you too!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "“但是大星的妈妈不喜欢我。她不喜欢我和大星一起玩。”我有点儿不高兴。",
      "traditional": "“但是大星的媽媽不喜歡我。她不喜歡我和大星一起玩。”我有點兒不高興。",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì dà xīng de mā ma bù xǐ huan wǒ tā bù xǐ huan wǒ hé dà xīng yì qǐ wán wǒ yǒu diǎn'r bù gāo xìng",
      "english": "“But Daxing’s mom doesn’t like me. She doesn’t like me Daxing and me playing together.” I was a little unhappy."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "“我懂。我也想和我的主人在一起。”苹果说。",
      "traditional": "“我懂。我也想和我的主人在一起。”蘋果說。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ dǒng wǒ yě xiǎng hé wǒ de zhǔ rén zài yì qǐ píng guǒ shuō",
      "english": "“I understand. I also want to be together with my owner,” said Apple."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "“上午、中午、下午、晚上，都在一起。”我说。",
      "traditional": "“上午、中午、下午、晚上，都在一起。”我說。",
      "pinyin": "shàng wǔ zhōng wǔ xià wǔ wǎn shang dōu zài yì qǐ wǒ shuō",
      "english": "“Morning, midday, afternoon, evening. Together all the time,” I said."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "我能和大星玩，我也能和大星学习。我们能一起看书。我有很多电子书。",
      "traditional": "我能和大星玩，我也能和大星學習。我們能一起看書。我有很多電子書。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ néng hé dà xīng wán wǒ yě néng hé dà xīng xué xí wǒ men néng yì qǐ kàn shū wǒ yǒu hěn duō diàn zi shū",
      "english": "I can play with Daxing, and I can also study with Daxing. We can read books together. I have a lot of e-books."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "Google和Baidu也很好，我们能看很多好东西。",
      "traditional": "Google和Baidu也很好，我們能看很多好東西。",
      "pinyin": "2 hé 2 yě hěn hǎo wǒ men néng kàn hěn duō hǎo dōng xi",
      "english": "Google and Baidu are also very good. We can read a lot of good things."
    },
